1
00:00:00,350 --> 00:00:02,809
You decided to point them upstairs.

2
00:00:02,879 --> 00:00:03,719
You step back.

3
00:00:03,769 --> 00:00:04,879
Out of the glass.

4
00:00:04,929 --> 00:00:06,533
And you look at Safwan.

5
00:00:06,603 --> 00:00:08,297
He closes his mouth.

6
00:00:08,527 --> 00:00:09,327
You tell Grete,

7
00:00:09,377 --> 00:00:11,554
the man you want is upstairs.

8
00:00:11,604 --> 00:00:12,049
Lida,

9
00:00:12,099 --> 00:00:13,049
the serving girl,

10
00:00:13,099 --> 00:00:15,053
runs for Marta's keys.

11
00:00:15,124 --> 00:00:17,219
Three lanterns climb the stairs.

12
00:00:17,269 --> 00:00:19,059
Safwan climbs with them.

13
00:00:19,109 --> 00:00:20,542
He doesn't look back.

14
00:00:20,692 --> 00:00:21,192
The bolt.

15
00:00:21,242 --> 00:00:21,877
The key.

16
00:00:21,927 --> 00:00:23,715
The door swings in.

17
00:00:23,785 --> 00:00:25,195
The stranger is gone.

18
00:00:25,245 --> 00:00:26,964
The window is open.

19
00:00:27,034 --> 00:00:29,457
But someone is lying on the floor.

20
00:00:29,527 --> 00:00:30,647
Otto. Alive.

21
00:00:30,697 --> 00:00:31,590
Barely.

22
00:00:31,981 --> 00:00:33,176
Grete waves you in.

23
00:00:33,226 --> 00:00:33,796
Clerk.

24
00:00:33,846 --> 00:00:35,090
Bring your pen.

25
00:00:35,159 --> 00:00:35,879
You can't.

26
00:00:35,929 --> 00:00:36,984
It's his room.

27
00:00:37,034 --> 00:00:38,848
And he never invited you.

28
00:00:38,898 --> 00:00:42,123
Your foot stops at the doorway like it's hit glass.

29
00:00:42,273 --> 00:00:43,913
Otto opens his eyes.

30
00:00:43,963 --> 00:00:45,714
He sees you in the doorway.

31
00:00:45,764 --> 00:00:49,745
The only man in Rabenfels who knows what you buy from him.

32
00:00:49,895 --> 00:00:52,795
He pulls Lida close and whispers something.

33
00:00:53,025 --> 00:00:53,930
Lida looks up.

34
00:00:53,980 --> 00:00:55,002
At you.

35
00:00:55,473 --> 00:00:56,938
Grete wants you inside.

36
00:00:56,988 --> 00:00:58,348
Lida knows something.

37
00:00:58,398 --> 00:00:59,927
What's your next move?

38
00:00:59,977 --> 00:01:02,616
Top comment chooses your next move.
